# Third-party SDK, cloned on demand. CMake prints the exact clone command if it is missing.
vendor/

# CMake output
build/

# Built plugin, staged by the post-build step. Rebuildable, so not tracked.
code/red4ext/plugins/PathfindingUpdate/*.dll
code/red4ext/plugins/PathfindingUpdate/*.pdb

# Bake artifacts - ignored by GIT, but the .vnavbake DOES ship with the release.
#
# These are two different questions and only the first one is settled by this file:
#   - In git? No. The .vnavgeo is ~1.4 GB and the .vnavbake ~173 MB, both far past GitHub's
#     100 MB per-file hard limit, and both are reproducible from the game archives
#     (WolvenKit `navbake` then `vnav_bake` - see README.md).
#   - In the shipped mod? Yes, the .vnavbake. It is staged under
#     code/red4ext/plugins/PathfindingUpdate/ and the plugin is useless without it.
#
# So a fresh clone will NOT have a bake and must generate one before the mod does anything.
bake/
*.vnavgeo
*.vnavbake
